msgstr "停用自動完成"

msgid "This field is required."
msgstr "此欄位是必需的。"

msgid "CSP: Directive @directive violated.<br /> Blocked URI: @blocked_uri.<br /> <pre>Data: @data</pre>"
msgstr "CSP：指引 @directive 違規。<br /> 封鎖的 URI：@blocked_uri。<br /> <pre>資料：@data</pre>"

msgid "Access denied"
msgstr "拒絕存取"

msgid "This module provides your website with various options to mitigate risks of common web application vulnerabilities like Cross-site Scripting, Cross-site Request Forgery and Clickjacking. It also has some options to improve your SSL/TLS security and fixes Drupal 6 core Upload module issue leading to an easy exploitation of an old Internet Explorer MIME sniffer HTML injection vulnerability. Note that some security features are not supported by all browsers. You may find this out at <a href=\":browserscope\">@browserscope</a>."
msgstr "此模組為您的網站提供了各種選項，用以降低一般 Web 應用程式漏洞的風險，像是跨網站 Scripting、偽造跨網站要求和點擊劫持等。此模組也提供某些可為您改善 SSL/TLS 安全性的選項，並修正導致舊版 Internet Explorer MIME 錯誤偵測器 HTML 注入漏洞輕易遭到不當利用的 Drupal 6 核心「上傳」模組問題。請注意，部分安全功能並未在所有瀏覽器上都受到支援。您可以在 <a href=\":browserscope\">@browserscope</a> 瞭解相關資訊。"

msgid "Cross-site Scripting"
msgstr "跨網站 Scripting"

msgid "Configure levels and various techniques of protection from cross-site scripting attacks"
msgstr "配置對跨網站 Scripting 攻擊的防護層次和各種技術"

msgid "Content Security Policy"
msgstr "內容安全原則"

msgid "Content Security Policy is a policy framework that allows to specify trustworthy sources of content and to restrict its capabilities. You may read more about it at <a href=\":wiki\">@wiki</a>."
msgstr "「內容安全原則」是一種原則架構，可用來指定可信的內容來源，並限制其功能。您可以在 <a href=\":wiki\">@wiki</a> 進一步閱讀其相關資訊。"

msgid "Send Content-Security-Policy HTTP response header with the list of Content Security Policy directives."
msgstr "使用「內容安全原則」指引的清單傳送 Content-Security-Policy HTTP 回應標頭。"

msgid "Vendor Prefixed CSP headers"
msgstr "供應商字首 CSP 標頭"

msgid "Support for legacy vendor-prefixed CSP headers. Details at <a href=\":caniuse\">@caniuse</a>."
msgstr "支援舊式供應商字首 CSP 標頭。<a href=\":caniuse\">@caniuse</a> 的詳細資料。"

msgid "Send vendor-prefixed X-Content-Security-Policy HTTP response headers with the list of Content Security Policy directives."
msgstr "使用「內容安全原則」指引的清單傳送供應商字首 X-Content-Security-Policy HTTP 回應標頭。"

msgid "Send vendor-prefixed X-WebKit-CSP HTTP response headers with the list of Content Security Policy directives."
msgstr "使用「內容安全原則」指引的清單傳送供應商字首 X-WebKit-CSP HTTP 回應標頭。"

msgid "Enable Upgrade Insecure Requests"
msgstr "啟用升級不安全的要求"

msgid "Upgrade Insecure Requests (upgrade-insecure-requests) instructs user agents to rewrite URL schemes, changing HTTP to HTTPS. This directive is used to protect your visitors from insecure content or for websites with large numbers of old URL's that need to be rewritten."
msgstr "升級不安全的要求 (upgrade-insecure-requests) 指示使用者代理程式重寫 URL 架構，將 HTTP 變更為 HTTPS。此指引用於保護您的訪客遠離不安全的內容，或者包含大量需要重寫的舊 URL 的網站。"

msgid "Report Only"
msgstr "僅報告"

msgid "Use Content Security Policy in report-only mode. In this case, violations of policies will only be reported, not blocked. Use this while configuring policies. Reports are logged."
msgstr "以「僅報告」模式使用「內容安全原則」。在此情況下，只會報告原則違規，而不會封鎖原則。在配置原則時，請使用此模式。報告會產生日誌。"

msgid "Directives"
msgstr "指引"

msgid "Set up security policy for different types of content. Don't use www prefix. Keywords (which must be surrounded by single quotes) are: @keywords Wildcards (*) are allowed: @wildcards More information is available at <a href=\":spec\">@spec</a>."
msgstr "為不同類型的內容設定安全原則。不要使用 www 字首。關鍵字（必須以單引號括住）為：@keywords，容許使用萬用字元 (*)：@wildcards。您可在 <a href=\":spec\">@spec</a> 取得相關資訊。"

msgid "Specify security policy for all types of content, which are not specified further (frame-ancestors excepted). Default is 'self'."
msgstr "指定所有內容類型的安全原則；這些內容類型並未進一步指定（frame-ancestors 除外）。預設值為 'self'。"

msgid "Specify trustworthy sources for &lt;script&gt; elements."
msgstr "為 &lt;script&gt; 元素指定可信的來源。"

msgid "Specify trustworthy sources for &lt;object&gt;, &lt;embed&gt; and &lt;applet&gt; elements."
msgstr "為 &lt;object&gt;、&lt;embed&gt; 和 &lt;applet&gt; 元素指定可信的來源。"

msgid "Specify trustworthy sources for stylesheets. Note, that inline stylesheets and style attributes of HTML elements are allowed."
msgstr "為樣式表指定可信的來源。請注意，容許使用 HTML 元素的內嵌樣式表和樣式屬性。"

msgid "Specify trustworthy sources for &lt;img&gt; elements."
msgstr "為 &lt;img&gt; 元素指定可信的來源。"

msgid "Specify trustworthy sources for &lt;audio&gt; and &lt;video&gt; elements."
msgstr "為 &lt;audio&gt; 和 &lt;video&gt; 元素指定可信的來源。"

msgid "Specify trustworthy sources for &lt;iframe&gt; and &lt;frame&gt; elements. This directive is deprecated and will be replaced by child-src. It is recommended to use the both the frame-src and child-src directives until all browsers you support recognize the child-src directive."
msgstr "為 &lt;iframe&gt; 和 &lt;frame&gt; 元素指定可信的來源。此指引已淘汰，將取代為 child-src。在您所支援的所有瀏覽器皆可辨識 child-src 指引之前，建議您同時使用 frame-src 和 child-src 指引。"

msgid "Specify trustworthy hosts which are allowed to embed this site's resources via &lt;iframe&gt;, &lt;frame&gt;, &lt;object&gt;, &lt;embed&gt; and &lt;applet&gt; elements."
msgstr "指定容許透過 &lt;iframe&gt;、&lt;frame&gt;、&lt;object&gt;、&lt;embed&gt; 及 &lt;applet&gt; 元素來內嵌此網站資源的可靠主機。"

msgid "Specify trustworthy sources for &lt;iframe&gt; and &lt;frame&gt; elements as well as for loading Workers."
msgstr "為 &lt;iframe&gt; 和 &lt;frame&gt; 元素以及載入工作程式指定可信的來源。"

msgid "Specify trustworthy sources for @font-src CSS loads."
msgstr "為 @font-src CSS 負載指定可信的來源。"

msgid "Specify trustworthy sources for XMLHttpRequest, WebSocket and EventSource connections."
msgstr "為 XMLHttpRequest、WebSocket 和 EventSource 連線指定可信的來源。"

msgid "Specify a URL (can be relative to the Drupal root, or absolute) to which user-agents will report CSP violations. Use the default value, unless you have set up an alternative handler for these reports. Note that if you specify a custom relative path, it should typically be accessible by all users (including anonymous). Defaults to <code>@report-url</code> which logs the report data."
msgstr "指定使用者代理程式將向其報告 CSP 違規的 URL（可相對於 Drupal 根，或為絕對 URL）。除非您為這些報告設定了替代處理程式，否則請使用預設值。請注意，如果指定自訂相對路徑，則該路徑通常應該可由所有使用者（包括匿名使用者）存取。預設值為 <code>@report-url</code>（用於記錄報告資料）。"

msgid "Specify a URL (relative to the Drupal root) for a file containing the (entire) policy. <strong>All other directives will be omitted</strong> by Security Kit, as <code>policy-uri</code> may only be defined in the <em>absence</em> of other policy definitions in the <code>X-Content-Security-Policy</code> HTTP header. The MIME type for this URI <strong>must</strong> be <code>text/x-content-security-policy</code>, otherwise user-agents will enforce the policy <code>allow 'none'</code>  instead."
msgstr "為包含（整個）原則的檔案指定 URL（相對於 Drupal 根目錄）。「安全套件」會<strong>省略所有其他指引</strong>，因為只有在 <code>X-Content-Security-Policy</code> HTTP 標頭中<em>沒有</em>其他原則定義時，才定義 <code>policy-uri</code>。此 URI 的 MIME 類型<strong>必須</strong>是 <code>text/x-content-security-policy</code>，否則，使用者代理程式將會改為強制執行原則 <code>allow 'none'</code>。"

msgid "X-XSS-Protection header"
msgstr "X-XSS-Protection 標頭"

msgid "X-XSS-Protection HTTP response header controls Microsoft Internet Explorer, Google Chrome and Apple Safari internal XSS filters."
msgstr "X-XSS-Protection HTTP 回應標頭可控制 Microsoft Internet Explorer、Google Chrome 和 Apple Safari 的內部 XSS 過濾器。"

msgid "Disabled - XSS filter will work in default mode. Enabled by default"
msgstr "已停用 - XSS 過濾器將在預設模式中運作。依預設啟用"

msgid "0 - XSS filter will be disabled for a website. It may be useful because of <a href=\":link\">@link</a>"
msgstr "0 - 將會對網站停用 XSS 過濾器。因為 <a href=\":link\">@link</a>，這可能很有用"

msgid "1 - XSS filter will be left enabled, and will modify dangerous content"
msgstr "1 - XSS 過濾器會保持啟用，並修改危險的內容"

msgid "1; mode=block - XSS filter will be left enabled, but it will block entire page instead of modifying dangerous content"
msgstr "1; mode=block - XSS 過濾器會保持啟用，但將封鎖整個頁面，而不是修改危險的內容"

msgid "Configure"
msgstr "設置"

msgid "@values"
msgstr "@values"

msgid "Cross-site Request Forgery"
msgstr "偽造跨網站要求"

msgid "Configure levels and various techniques of protection from cross-site request forgery attacks"
msgstr "配置對偽造跨網站要求攻擊的防護層次和各種技術"

msgid "HTTP Origin"
msgstr "HTTP 原點"

msgid "Check Origin HTTP request header."
msgstr "檢查原點 HTTP 要求標頭。"

msgid "Allow requests from"
msgstr "容許要求來源"

msgid "Comma separated list of trustworthy sources. Do not enter your website URL - it is automatically added. Syntax of the source is: [protocol] :// [host] : [port] . E.g, http://example.com, https://example.com, https://www.example.com, http://www.example.com:8080"
msgstr "可信來源的逗點區隔清單。不要輸入您的網站 URL - 系統會自動加入。來源的語法為：[protocol] :// [host] : [port]。例如，http://example.com, https://example.com, https://www.example.com, http://www.example.com:8080"

msgid "Configure levels and various techniques of protection from Clickjacking/UI Redressing attacks"
msgstr "配置對點擊劫持/使用者介面偽裝攻擊的防護層次和各種技術"

msgid "X-Frame-Options header"
msgstr "X-Frame-Options 標頭"

msgid "Configure the X-Frame-Options HTTP header"
msgstr "配置 X-Frame-Options HTTP 標頭"

msgid "X-Frame-Options"
msgstr "X-Frame-Options"

msgid "X-Frame-Options HTTP response header controls browser's policy of frame rendering. Possible values: @values You may read more about it at <a href=\":msdn\">@msdn</a> or <a href=\":spec\">@spec</a>."
msgstr "X-Frame-Options HTTP 回應標頭可控制瀏覽器的頁框呈現原則。可能的值：@values。您可以在 <a href=\":msdn\">@msdn</a> 或 <a href=\":spec\">@spec</a> 進一步閱讀其相關資訊。"

msgid "ALLOW-FROM"
msgstr "ALLOW-FROM"

msgid "Origin URIs (as specified by RFC 6454) for the \"X-Frame-Options: ALLOW-FROM\" value. One per line. If the request does not contain a matching Origin header, the last value will be used. Example, http://domain.com"
msgstr "\"X-Frame-Options: ALLOW-FROM\" 值的原點 URI（如 RFC 6454 指定）。每行一個。如果要求不包含相符的 Origin 標頭，則將使用最後一個值。例如，http://domain.com"

msgid "JavaScript-based protection"
msgstr "JavaScript 型保護"

msgid "Warning: With this enabled, the site <em>will not work at all</em> for users who have JavaScript disabled (e.g. users running the popular <a href=\":noscript\">@noscript</a> browser extension, if they haven't whitelisted your site)."
msgstr "警告：此選項啟用時，對於將 JavaScript 停用的使用者（例如，執行通用 <a href=\":noscript\">@noscript</a> 瀏覽器延伸，且未將您的網站列入白名單的使用者），網站<em>將完全無法運作</em>。"

msgid "seckit.document_write.js"
msgstr "seckit.document_write.js"

msgid "document.write()"
msgstr "document.write()"

msgid "stop SecKit protection"
msgstr "停止 SecKit 保護"

msgid "seckit.no_body.css"
msgstr "seckit.no_body.css"

msgid "display: none"
msgstr "顯示畫面：無"

msgid "Enable protection via JavaScript, CSS and &lt;noscript&gt; tag. This is the most efficient Clickjacking prevention technique. If website is not being framed, %js starts commenting with <em>document.write()</em> and stops when the comment %stop is reached. Thus %css, which hides the page body, is ignored. If particularly this JavaScript file is being blocked (with XSS filter of Internet Explorer 8 or Safari), %css applies <em>display: none</em> to <em>body</em>, hiding it. If JavaScript is disabled within browser, it shows a special message. Credits for this trick go to <a href=\":eduardovela\">@eduardovela</a>."
msgstr "透過 JavaScript、CSS 和 &lt;noscript&gt; 標籤啟用保護。這是最有效率的點擊劫持防護技術。如果網站未進行頁框處理，%js 即會使用 <em>document.write()</em> 開始加註，並在達到註解 %stop 時停止。因此，隱藏頁面內文的 %css 會被忽略。特別是如果此 JavaScript 檔案將被封鎖（透過 Internet Explorer 8 或 Safari 的 XSS 檔案），則 %css 會將<em>顯示畫面：無</em>套用至<em>內文</em>而加以隱藏。如果瀏覽器內已停用 JavaScript，則會顯示一則特殊訊息。如需此技巧的相關資訊，請造訪 <a href=\":eduardovela\">@eduardovela</a>。"

msgid "This message will be shown to user when JavaScript is disabled or unsupported in his browser. Default is \"Sorry, you need to enable JavaScript to visit this website.\""
msgstr "當使用者的瀏覽器已停用或不支援 JavaScript 時，使用者會看到此訊息。預設值為「抱歉，您必須啟用 JavaScript 才能造訪此網站。」"

msgid "SSL/TLS"
msgstr "SSL/TLS"

msgid "Configure various techniques to improve security of SSL/TLS"
msgstr "配置各種技術以改善 SSL/TLS 的安全性"

msgid "Enable Strict-Transport-Security HTTP response header. HTTP Strict Transport Security (HSTS) header is proposed to prevent eavesdropping and man-in-the-middle attacks like SSLStrip, when a single non-HTTPS request is enough for credential theft or hijacking. It forces browser to connect to the server in HTTPS-mode only and automatically convert HTTP links into secure before sending request. <a href=\":wiki\">@wiki</a> has more information about HSTS"
msgstr "啟用 Strict-Transport-Security HTTP 回應標頭。只要一個非 HTTPS 要求即足以竊取或強制存取認證時，建議使用「HTTP 嚴格傳輸安全 (HSTS)」標頭，以防止竊聽和攔截式攻擊（如 SSLStrip）。此標頭會強制瀏覽器僅以 HTTPS 模式連接至伺服器，並自動先將 HTTP 鏈結轉換為安全鏈結，才傳送要求。<a href=\":wiki\">@wiki</a> 提供了 HSTS 的相關資訊"

msgid "Specify Max-Age value in seconds. It sets period when user-agent should remember receipt of this header field from this server. Default is 1000."
msgstr "指定 Max-Age 值（以秒為單位）。此值會設定使用者代理程式應該記住從這部伺服器收到此標頭欄位的期間。預設值為 1000。"

msgid "Include Subdomains"
msgstr "包括子網域"

msgid "Force HTTP Strict Transport Security for all subdomains. If enabled, HSTS policy will be applied for all subdomains, otherwise only for the main domain."
msgstr "對所有子網域強制執行「HTTP 嚴格傳輸安全」。如果已啟用，將會對所有子網域套用 HSTS 原則；否則，只會套用至主要網域。"

msgid "Preload"
msgstr "預載"

msgid "If you intend to submit your domain to the <a href=\":hsts_preload_list\">@hsts_preload_list</a>, you will need to enable the preload flag as confirmation. Don't submit your domain unless you're sure that you can support HTTPS for the long term, as this action cannot be undone."
msgstr "如果您打算將您的網域提交至 <a href=\":hsts_preload_list\">@hsts_preload_list</a>，則必須啟用預載標示，以作為確認。您必須確定可以長期支援 HTTPS，才能提交您的網域，因為此動作無法復原。"

msgid "Configure the Expect-CT header which allows sites to opt in to reporting and/or enforcement of Certificate Transparency requirements. See <a href=\":expect-ct_docs\">@expect-ct_docs</a>."
msgstr "配置 Expect-CT 標頭以容許網站接受報告及/或強制執行「憑證透通性」需求。請參閱 <a href=\":expect-ct_docs\">@expect-ct_docs</a>。"

msgid "Enable the Expect-CT header."
msgstr "啟用 Expect-CT 標頭。"

msgid "Specify Max-Age value in seconds."
msgstr "指定 Max-Age 值（以秒為單位）。"

msgid "Report-uri"
msgstr "Report-uri"

msgid "Specify the (absolute) URI to which the user agent should report Expect-CT failures."
msgstr "指定使用者代理程式應向其報告 Expect-CT 失敗的（絕對）URI。"

msgid "Enforce the Certificate Transparency policy."
msgstr "強制執行「憑證透通性」原則。"

msgid "Allows configuration of the Feature-Policy header to selectively enable, disable, and modify the behavior of certain APIs and web features in the browser. See <a href=\":feature-policy_docs\">@feature-policy_docs</a>."
msgstr "容許配置 Feature-Policy 標頭，以選擇性地啟用、停用及修改瀏覽器中特定 API 和 Web 特性的行為。請參閱 <a href=\":feature-policy_docs\">@feature-policy_docs</a>。"

msgid "Enable the Feature-Policy header."
msgstr "啟用 Feature-Policy 標頭。"

msgid "Specify the policy to be sent out with Feature-Policy headers."
msgstr "指定要使用 Feature-Policy 標頭送出的原則。"

msgid "Miscellaneous"
msgstr "細項"

msgid "Configure miscellaneous unsorted security enhancements"
msgstr "配置細項未排序的安全加強功能"

msgid "Enable From-Origin HTTP response header. This forces user-agent to retrieve embedded content from your site only to listed destination. More information is available at <a href=\":spec\">@spec</a> page."
msgstr "啟用 From-Origin HTTP 回應標頭。這會強制使用者代理程式從您的網站擷取內嵌的內容，並且僅擷取至列出的目的地。您可在 <a href=\":spec\">@spec</a> 頁面上取得相關資訊。"

msgid "Trustworthy destination. Possible variants are: @items"
msgstr "可信的目的地。可能的變式為：@items"

msgid "Enable Referrer-Policy HTTP response header. This affects the Referer HTTP header for outgoing requests and navigations. More information is available at the <a href=\":spec\">@spec</a> page."
msgstr "啟用 Referrer-Policy HTTP 回應標頭。這會影響送出要求和導覽的 Referer HTTP 標頭。<a href=\":spec\">@spec</a> 頁面提供了更多資訊。"

msgid "no-referrer - No referrer information will be sent."
msgstr "no-referrer - 將不傳送參考者資訊。"

msgid "no-referrer-when-downgrade - No referrer information will be sent when navigating from HTTPS to HTTP."
msgstr "no-referrer-when-downgrade - 從 HTTPS 導覽至 HTTP 時將不傳送參考者資訊。"

msgid "same-origin - Referrer information is sent only with requests to the same origin."
msgstr "same-origin - 僅傳送具有相同原點要求的參考者資訊。"

msgid "origin - This will strip any path information from the referrer information."
msgstr "origin - 這會從參考者資訊中刪除任何路徑資訊。"

msgid "strict-origin - Like no-referrer-when-downgrade, but sends only the origin."
msgstr "strict-origin - 與 no-referrer-when-downgrade 相似，但僅傳送原點。"

msgid "origin-when-cross-origin - Sends full referrer information with same-origin requests, and origin only with cross-origin requests."
msgstr "origin-when-cross-origin - 傳送具有相同原點要求的完整參考者資訊，以及僅傳送具有跨原點要求的原點。"

msgid "strict-origin-when-cross-origin - Sends full referrer information with same-origin requests, origin only with cross-origin requests, and no referrer information if downgrading from https to http."
msgstr "strict-origin-when-cross-origin - 傳送具有相同原點要求的完整參考者資訊，以及僅傳送具有跨原點要求的原點，但從 HTTPS 降級至 HTTP 時將不傳送參考者資訊。"

msgid "unsafe-url - Sends full referrer information with all requests; as the name implies, this is not safe."
msgstr "unsafe-url - 傳送具有所有要求的完整參考者資訊；顧名思義，這是不安全的。"

msgid "\"\" (empty string) - Default to no-referrer-when-downgrade unless a higher-level policy has been defined elsewhere."
msgstr "\"\"（空字串）- 除非在其他位置定義了更高層次的原則，否則預設為 no-referrer-when-downgrade。"

msgid "\"\" (empty string)"
msgstr "\"\"（空字串）"

msgid "Policy options are: @items"
msgstr "原則選項為：@items"

msgid "Disable autocomplete on login and registration forms"
msgstr "停用登入和登錄表單上的自動完成"

msgid "Prevent the browser from populating login/registration form fields using its autocomplete functionality. This as populated fields may contain sensitive information, facilitating unauthorized access."
msgstr "防止瀏覽器使用其自動完成功能將資料移入登入/登錄表單欄位。這是因為移入資料的欄位可能包含機密性資訊，而助長未獲授權的存取。"

msgid "You have to set up trustworthy destination for From-Origin HTTP response header. Default is same."
msgstr "您必須為 From-Origin HTTP 回應標頭設定可信的目的地。預設值為 same。"

msgid "You must specify a trusted Origin for the ALLOW-FROM value of the X-Frame-Options HTTP response header."
msgstr "您必須為 X-Frame-Options HTTP 回應標頭的 ALLOW-FROM 值指定信任的原點。"

msgid "You have to set up Max-Age value for HTTP Strict Transport Security. Default is 1000."
msgstr "您必須為「HTTP 嚴格傳輸安全」設定 Max-Age 值。預設值為 1000。"

msgid "Only digits are allowed in HTTP Strict Transport Security Max-Age field."
msgstr "「HTTP 嚴格傳輸安全」的 Max-Age 欄位中只能使用數字。"

msgid "You have to set up Custom text for disabled JavaScript message when JS + CSS + Noscript protection is enabled."
msgstr "當 JS + CSS + Noscript 保護啟用時，您必須為已停用的 JavaScript 訊息設定自訂文字。"

msgid "The CSP report-uri seems absolute but does not seem to be a valid URI."
msgstr "CSP report-uri 似乎是絕對的，但似乎不是有效的 URI。"

msgid "The CSP report-uri seems relative but does not seem to be a valid path."
msgstr "CSP report-uri 似乎是相對的，但似乎不是有效的路徑。"

